{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42784","headline":"春夕遣怀 · 刘兼","name":"春夕遣怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穷通分定莫凄凉，且放欢情入醉乡。\n范蠡扁舟终去相，冯唐半世只爲郎。\n风飘玉笛梅初落，酒泛金樽月未央。\n休把虚名挠怀抱，九原丘陇尽侯王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}